# Cline / Kilo Code Rules for Velora Perfumes

Read `AGENTS.md` and `TASK_BOARD.md` upon session start.

- Stack: HTML5 + Vanilla CSS (`styles.css`) + Vanilla JavaScript (`app.js`).
- Currency: GH₵ (Ghana Cedis).
- Ordering: WhatsApp concierge delivery flow (`VEL-XXXXXX`).
- Cross-agent collaboration: Work in tandem with Antigravity. Check `TASK_BOARD.md` before making changes.
- Safe DOM handling: Always null-check DOM elements (`if (el) ...`).
